OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor has said he
OL,8,Fcame face-to-face with an alleged
OL,9,Fstalker who chased him in a
OL,10,Fconfrontation near his Sandringham
OL,11,Fhome, a court has heard.
OL,13,FAlex Jenkinson, 39, is charged with
OL,14,Fusing threatening, abusive or
OL,15,Finsulting words or behaviour towards
OL,16,Fthe former Prince in Norfolk on May 6.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
