CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FSuffolk Police are also applying for a
OL,8,Fcivil Stalking Protection Order
OL,9,Fagainst Jenkinson, based on evidence
OL,10,Ffrom Andrew, and searches carried out
OL,11,Fon Jenkinson's phone.
OL,13,FDeputy Chief Magistrate Tan Ikram read
OL,14,Fout quotes from Andrew's witness
OL,15,Fstatement, which is expected to form a
OL,16,Fcentral part of both legal
OL,17,Fproceedings, at Westminster
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
