PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FThe former Duke of York said that
OL,8,Fwhile out walking his dogs on the
OL,9,Festate, he spotted a car he believed
OL,10,Fbelonged to press photographers.
OL,12,FHe said he and his security detail
OL,13,Fthen "drove past the car".
OL,15,FHe said a man "turned and faced me -
OL,16,Fhe was wearing a balaclava face
OL,17,Fcovering".
OL,26,@uD@FOUuD@YO]wD@OOUyD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FAndrew provided a description of the
OL,8,F"out-of-place" man and added in his
OL,9,Fstatement: "I then saw a loose dog
OL,10,Frunning towards him.
OL,12,F"Then he realised who I was and began
OL,13,Fto sprint after my vehicle."
OL,15,FThursday's court hearing took place in
OL,16,FJenkinson's absence after he arrived
OL,17,Fwith his dog, Indie, and was blocked
OL,18,Ffrom entering the building by court
OL,19,Fofficials.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@NO]qD@LOUtD@AOUuD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FAs Jenkinson stood on the pavement
OL,8,Foutside, his lawyer, Claire Howell,
OL,9,Ftold Judge Ikram: "He has had to bring
OL,10,Fhis dog with him, so he wasn't allowed
OL,11,Finside the court.
OL,13,F"He is homeless and currently in
OL,14,Faccommodation in a Travelodge.
OL,16,F"He is not allowed to leave the dog
OL,17,Fthere. It provides him with support,
OL,18,Fhe suffers from ADHD."
OL,26,@qD@SOUuD@AOUxD@AOUzD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31006
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FShe conceded that she had no documents
OL,8,Fto prove Jenkinson's medical condition
OL,9,For his need for a support animal, and
OL,10,Fthe judge told her: "I'm not prepared
OL,11,Fto have a dog in the courtroom simply
OL,12,Fbecause he is homeless and he happens
OL,13,Fto keep a dog.
OL,15,F"I'm not saying he is not telling the
OL,16,Ftruth but there's nothing to
OL,17,Fcorroborate it."
OL,26,@rD@UOUwD@AOUyD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
