PN,31007
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FHe added: "We accommodate people who
OL,8,Fhave ADHD and have support animals. I
OL,9,Fwould want something more than he is
OL,10,Fhomeless and happens to have a dog."
OL,12,FThe judge approved an application to
OL,13,Fadjourn the police bid for a Stalking
OL,14,FProtection Order and ruled that the
OL,15,Fhearing could proceed in Jenkinson's
OL,16,Fabsence.
OL,26,@oD@KOUrD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
