OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FJenkinson is accused of causing the
OL,8,Fformer Duke of York to "fear unlawful
OL,9,Fviolence" during a confrontation in
OL,10,FWolferton, near his Marsh Farm
OL,11,Fproperty.
OL,13,FHe was detained under the Mental
OL,14,FHealth Act for around a month
OL,15,Fafterwards and has pleaded guilty to
OL,16,Ffailing to provide a blood sample
OL,17,Fwhile in custody on May 6.
OL,19,FHowever, he denies the public order
OL,20,Foffence against Andrew Mountbatten-
OL,21,FWindsor.
OL,26,@pD@XOUqD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31009
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FHe has also pleaded not guilty to a
OL,8,Fseparate charge of using threatening,
OL,9,Fabusive or insulting words or
OL,10,Fbehaviour with intent to cause fear or
OL,11,Fprovoke unlawful violence against
OL,12,FStephen Terry in King's Lynn on May 5.
OL,14,FAndrew is due to give evidence via
OL,15,Fvideo link at the criminal trial,
OL,16,Fwhich has been scheduled for December
OL,17,F21.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
