PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786054681
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor 'chased by
OL,4,Cstalker in balaclava' while walking
OL,5,Cdogs
OL,7,FAt the end of Thursday's hearing,
OL,8,FJudge Ikram extended the interim
OL,9,FStalking Protection Order against
OL,10,FJenkinson.
OL,12,FHe set a pre-trial hearing at
OL,13,FLoughborough Magistrates' Court for
OL,14,FJanuary 22, with the final hearing due
OL,15,Fto take place at Westminster
OL,16,FMagistrates' Court on February 16.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
